WEBVTT

00:10:57.631 --> 00:11:00.371
Volíme nepoužiť nič.

00:11:00.555 --> 00:11:02.863
(potlesk)

00:11:02.887 --> 00:11:03.638
Pokiaľ vy…

00:11:03.638 --> 00:11:10.212
(potlesk)

00:11:10.326 --> 00:11:14.406
Pokiaľ naozaj chcete vedieť,
či je žena panna, alebo nie,

00:11:14.785 --> 00:11:15.939
opýtajte sa jej.

00:11:15.963 --> 00:11:17.113
(smiech)

00:11:17.449 --> 00:11:22.046
Ale to, ako odpovie
na túto otázku, je jej vec.

00:11:23.771 --> 00:11:24.922
Ďakujeme.

00:11:24.946 --> 00:11:27.314
(potlesk)